WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:05.868
-And now we're gonna get to
the news.

00:00:05.868 --> 00:00:09.901
After President Biden met last
week with the KPop band BTS,

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:12.567
the White House posted a video
to Instagram

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:15.367
that showed Biden playing
the group's hit song "Butter"

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:17.767
but they cut out the part where
he asked them

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:21.868
to please write a song about
something he's allowed to have.

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:25.033
"'Smooth like hummus,'
how 'bout that?"

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:28.200
President Biden delivered
an address on Thursday night

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.234
from the White House and called
on Congress to pass

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:34.934
gun safety legislation, which is
kind of like calling on the Jets

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.367
to win the Super Bowl.

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:41.200
You can ask...!

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.968
That's right, President Biden
delivered an address

00:00:43.968 --> 00:00:46.601
on Thursday night and called on
Congress to ban

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:49.400
assault-style weapons and expand
background checks,

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.968
or at the very least get rid of
the vending machines.

00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:56.501
Dr. Mehmet Oz last week won
Pennsylvania's

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:59.667
Republican senate primary,
which seems a little crazy,

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:01.434
I mean, is he even qualified...

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:05.267
to be a doctor?!

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:07.367
The House Select Committee
investigating

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:10.501
the Capitol attack will hold its
first public hearing on Thursday

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:12.934
so we can all
finally get to the bottom

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:16.667
of that thing the entire country
watched on live TV in real time.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:21.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.934 --> 00:01:25.234
A man recently threw cake on
the protective glass of

00:01:25.234 --> 00:01:28.567
Leonardo da Vinci's
Mona Lisa painting at the Louvre

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:31.667
in Paris, he also threw some on
a Picasso,

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:35.000
but no one noticed.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.434
Yeah, we'll go after Picasso!

00:01:38.434 --> 00:01:42.767
You're not off of the hook,
Picasso!

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:45.734
Yesterday was National Hot Air
Balloon Day --

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:48.934
this news was first reported by
a very apologetic

00:01:48.934 --> 00:01:50.868
JetBlue gate agent.

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:52.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.000
Bays and I talked backstage
and we were like,

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.701
"I think we put 'JetBlue'
on the balloon."

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:05.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:10.100
You know what, I don't think it
would have mattered either way.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.100
During a --
[ Laughs ]

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:13.734
So did you guys
even understand, though?

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:16.868
I feel like you guys don't even
und--

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:18.334
You buy a ticket
on a JetBlue flight,

00:02:18.334 --> 00:02:20.400
and then you get to the gate
and they have to apologize

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.501
and be like, we're very sorry
it's Hot Air Balloon day,

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:24.033
you got to ride
a hot air balloon.

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:26.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:33.534
You know...

00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:38.200
We were on hiatus,
we're all a little rusty.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.167
During the parade over the
weekend honoring

00:02:40.167 --> 00:02:41.767
her Platinum Jubilee,

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:43.334
a hologram of Queen Elizabeth

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:45.267
was shown in her
gold stagecoach.

00:02:45.267 --> 00:02:47.000
And whatever you think
of the queen,

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.534
her duet with Tupac
was amazing.

00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:56.167
And finally, New York's
LaGuardia Airport

00:02:56.167 --> 00:02:59.534
over the weekend debuted
its newly renovated Terminal C,

00:02:59.534 --> 00:03:02.734
which features an 11 lane
security screening area.

00:03:02.734 --> 00:03:07.100
And this is cool --
one of them is open!

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.968
The first lady,
Dr. Jill Biden,

00:03:08.968 --> 00:03:11.701
yesterday unveiled
a new postage stamp

00:03:11.701 --> 00:03:14.067
that honors former
first lady Nancy Reagan.

00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:16.868
The stamp will be very helpful
when you need to figure out

00:03:16.868 --> 00:03:20.634
which birthday card
came from your grandparents.

00:03:20.634 --> 00:03:25.067
"Let's see -- flower,
flower, Snoopy, Gay Pride.

00:03:25.067 --> 00:03:27.567
Oh, here we go!"

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:29.701
Transportation Secretary
Pete Buttigieg announced

00:03:29.701 --> 00:03:31.701
yesterday
that he has tested positive

00:03:31.701 --> 00:03:33.834
for a breakthrough case
of the coronavirus.

00:03:33.834 --> 00:03:37.567
Unfortunately, he's still not
old enough for the vaccine.

00:03:40.334 --> 00:03:41.601
According to reports,

00:03:41.601 --> 00:03:44.567
former president Trump's
advisers are divided on

00:03:44.567 --> 00:03:46.767
if Trump should announce
his reelection campaign

00:03:46.767 --> 00:03:49.434
before this year's
midterm elections or wait

00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:52.067
so it does not take attention
away from other candidates.

00:03:52.067 --> 00:03:56.234
Oh, because he'd hate
stealing attention.

00:03:56.234 --> 00:03:59.801
Trump's like a bridesmaid who
keeps mentioning in her speech

00:03:59.801 --> 00:04:02.133
that it's her
half birthday.

00:04:05.601 --> 00:04:08.100
According to reports,
former president Trump

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.734
may launch his reelection
campaign on July 4th.

00:04:10.734 --> 00:04:15.133
So step aside, dogs,
it's our turn to hate that day!

00:04:18.267 --> 00:04:19.701
That's a good...

00:04:19.701 --> 00:04:23.534
Very good "scared of
a fireworks" dog right there.

00:04:23.534 --> 00:04:25.434
That's how you say it --
"a fireworks," right?

00:04:25.434 --> 00:04:27.934
Yeah. Yeah. It was --
It sounded weird,

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:30.367
but that's definitely
the way you say it.

00:04:30.367 --> 00:04:32.701
The sixth installment
of the dinosaur

00:04:32.701 --> 00:04:35.267
sci-fi series called
"Jurassic World: Dominion"

00:04:35.267 --> 00:04:36.968
will be released
this Friday in theaters.

00:04:36.968 --> 00:04:39.400
Man, if that series
goes on any longer,

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.634
they're going to have
to include mammals.

00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:45.701
"The horses are out!"

00:04:49.501 --> 00:04:52.234
Lawmakers in New York
recently passed the so called

00:04:52.234 --> 00:04:53.801
"Stop the Chop" act,

00:04:53.801 --> 00:04:55.868
which will allow residents
to sue companies

00:04:55.868 --> 00:04:57.334
for excessive
helicopter noise.

00:04:57.334 --> 00:04:59.000
So now New York residents

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.567
will only have to deal
with noise from garbage trucks,

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:03.634
"sweet-streepers," ambulances,
weed-"wrackers,"

00:05:03.634 --> 00:05:05.200
leaf blowers
and people screaming

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.801
when a rat pops its head
out of a bodega.

00:05:12.067 --> 00:05:15.033
And finally, a guinea pig
in Hungary named Molly

00:05:15.033 --> 00:05:18.000
was recently honored
with the Guinness World Record

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.901
for most basketball slam dunks
in 30 seconds.

00:05:20.901 --> 00:05:24.167
But before you get too excited,
full disclosure,

00:05:24.167 --> 00:05:28.767
apparently the rim was only set
at nine feet, six inches.

00:05:33.501 --> 00:05:35.200
You know, I was
a little concerned that

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.734
that was our closer.

00:05:36.734 --> 00:05:38.334
Yeah.

00:05:40.934 --> 00:05:42.868
You know, I --
I trust the process.

00:05:42.868 --> 00:05:44.234
Bays knows.

00:05:47.601 --> 00:05:49.567
I don't know why.
You know what, guys?

00:05:49.567 --> 00:05:52.868
Look, the important thing
is we told that joke.

00:05:52.868 --> 00:05:56.367
We had the courage
to tell it.

00:05:56.367 --> 00:06:00.667
President Biden is reportedly
preparing to forgive $10,000

00:06:00.667 --> 00:06:02.534
in student loan debt
for Americans

00:06:02.534 --> 00:06:04.901
who make less than $150,000.

00:06:04.901 --> 00:06:08.968
$10,000, or, as your college
calls it, a chemistry book.

00:06:10.968 --> 00:06:13.334
President Biden traveled today
to Los Angeles.

00:06:13.334 --> 00:06:16.667
Not sure what for, but it's got
to have something to do with

00:06:16.667 --> 00:06:20.234
"Top Gun."

00:06:20.234 --> 00:06:22.567
The public Congressional
hearings on the Capitol attack

00:06:22.567 --> 00:06:24.300
kick off tomorrow night
in prime time

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.167
and make sure to tune
in afterwards

00:06:26.167 --> 00:06:28.901
for "Talking Insurrection"
hosted by Chris Hardwick.

00:06:30.501 --> 00:06:31.767
Fox News announced this week

00:06:31.767 --> 00:06:33.334
that it will not
carry live coverage

00:06:33.334 --> 00:06:36.567
of Congress's prime time
hearings
over the Capitol attack

00:06:36.567 --> 00:06:38.734
to focus on more
important news like

00:06:38.734 --> 00:06:41.434
would it kill Mulan
to wear a dress?

00:06:45.601 --> 00:06:48.367
British Prime Minister
Boris Johnson on Monday

00:06:48.367 --> 00:06:51.767
narrowly survived a no
confidence vote in parliament.

00:06:51.767 --> 00:06:53.334
And from the looks of him,

00:06:53.334 --> 00:06:58.734
he also narrowly
survived electrocution.

00:06:58.734 --> 00:07:01.167
"I think the hair
looks quite good.

00:07:01.167 --> 00:07:03.734
I think I'll go on, now.

00:07:03.734 --> 00:07:05.968
Let everyone know
that I have confidence.

00:07:05.968 --> 00:07:11.133
I have confidence
that the hair is good."

00:07:11.133 --> 00:07:13.834
According to a new poll,
72% of New Yorkers believe

00:07:13.834 --> 00:07:16.067
Mayor Eric Adams
is doing better than

00:07:16.067 --> 00:07:19.100
or as well as his predecessor,
Bill de Blasio.

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.834
I knew if we just
gave him a chance

00:07:20.834 --> 00:07:24.434
he would prove just how much
we didn't like Bill de Blasio.

00:07:26.234 --> 00:07:29.133
The CDC this week
raised its monkeypox alert

00:07:29.133 --> 00:07:30.400
to level two, though,

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.133
if you want people
to take it seriously,

00:07:32.133 --> 00:07:37.000
don't change the alert level,
change the name "monkey pox."

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.434
Just sounds too cute.

00:07:38.434 --> 00:07:40.601
Monkey pox?

00:07:40.601 --> 00:07:44.834
Aww, you guys,
should we get it?!

00:07:44.834 --> 00:07:49.000
I'm going to get it
for the summer.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.267
A man in California
was arrested this week

00:07:51.267 --> 00:07:54.133
for allegedly stealing an
Olympic gold medal from a car.

00:07:54.133 --> 00:07:56.334
Officials suspected
the man was guilty

00:07:56.334 --> 00:07:59.234
when they very easily
caught up to him.

00:08:04.601 --> 00:08:05.901
Singer Jimmy Buffett's

00:08:05.901 --> 00:08:08.033
new Margaritaville at Sea
cruise line

00:08:08.033 --> 00:08:10.167
recently launched
its first ship

00:08:10.167 --> 00:08:12.267
for a one-night-only
inaugural voyage.

00:08:12.267 --> 00:08:16.267
And nothing says
safety like "Margaritaville,"

00:08:16.267 --> 00:08:19.067
a song that is about
a drunk guy who cuts himself

00:08:19.067 --> 00:08:21.167
and decides to get drunker.

00:08:25.968 --> 00:08:29.267
There are some people on this
show who are of the age

00:08:29.267 --> 00:08:33.934
that we know the plotlines
of the Jimmy Buffett songs.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.801
And finally, at a recent
press conference,

00:08:37.801 --> 00:08:39.501
a judge in India
referenced a case

00:08:39.501 --> 00:08:42.000
where a man filed
for divorce from his wife

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.334
because she cooked him
instant noodles for every meal.

00:08:44.334 --> 00:08:47.300
Well, fortunately for that guy,
he's already got a solid idea

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:49.367
of what single life
is going to be like.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.200
House Committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.000
held its first public
hearing tonight

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.167
where they called
their first witness --

00:08:58.167 --> 00:09:00.434
literally, all of us.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.667
That's right.
The January 6 Committee aired

00:09:06.667 --> 00:09:09.200
a 90 minute hearing tonight,
which was carried live

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.868
by all the major news networks
except Fox News.

00:09:11.868 --> 00:09:14.267
Though Fox ended up
with better ratings

00:09:14.267 --> 00:09:19.467
by just airing
the original Capitol attack.

00:09:19.467 --> 00:09:21.934
President Biden criticized
the Republican Party

00:09:21.934 --> 00:09:24.234
in a new interview
and said it has undergone

00:09:24.234 --> 00:09:25.667
a, quote, radical shift

00:09:25.667 --> 00:09:27.567
since former president Trump
was elected.

00:09:27.567 --> 00:09:30.601
I don't know, I think
they were always this radical,

00:09:30.601 --> 00:09:34.601
and then they elected a guy
who couldn't be subtle about it.

00:09:34.601 --> 00:09:36.167
It's like when you're
at a dinner party

00:09:36.167 --> 00:09:38.767
and you whisper to your wife,
"Dinner parties suck,"

00:09:38.767 --> 00:09:42.267
and then she says,
"Dinner parties suck?!"

00:09:42.267 --> 00:09:44.000
And then you have to say,
"Okay, yes,

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.334
I think dinner parties suck,
everybody!"

00:09:47.334 --> 00:09:50.033
President Biden said yesterday
that he's often asked

00:09:50.033 --> 00:09:52.400
why he does not play
the political games

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.667
that the Republicans play,
and said, quote,

00:09:54.667 --> 00:09:56.567
If we do the same thing
they do,

00:09:56.567 --> 00:09:58.968
our democracy will
literally be in jeopardy.

00:09:58.968 --> 00:10:02.200
Okay, you know, there was
a televised insurrection

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.701
hearing tonight, right?

00:10:03.701 --> 00:10:05.567
It's already in jeopardy.

00:10:05.567 --> 00:10:08.234
That's like the captain
of the Titanic saying,

00:10:08.234 --> 00:10:10.133
"I'm worried everyone
running to one side

00:10:10.133 --> 00:10:11.734
isn't good for the boat."

00:10:14.434 --> 00:10:16.934
Republican Senator John Kennedy
criticized

00:10:16.934 --> 00:10:18.367
the Biden administration
yesterday

00:10:18.367 --> 00:10:20.934
for not doing more to bring down
high gas prices

00:10:20.934 --> 00:10:23.067
and added that it would be,
quote,

00:10:23.067 --> 00:10:26.334
excuse me, it would be, quote,
cheaper to buy cocaine

00:10:26.334 --> 00:10:27.767
and just run everywhere,

00:10:27.767 --> 00:10:33.300
which -- which it's a pretty,
pretty cute joke.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:34.601
But mostly I want to know,

00:10:34.601 --> 00:10:36.467
where are you getting
a gallon of cocaine

00:10:36.467 --> 00:10:39.200
for $6?

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.300
Don't be stingy, Jack!

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.100
Arizona Republican
senate candidate

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:49.100
Blake Masters reportedly met
with conservative activists

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.300
earlier this year
at a Phoenix IHOP

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:53.968
and suggested that
the Capitol attack may have been

00:10:53.968 --> 00:10:56.634
a false flag operation
set up by the FBI,

00:10:56.634 --> 00:11:00.067
which is absolutely
the least crazy idea

00:11:00.067 --> 00:11:02.400
ever pitched at
a Phoenix IHOP.

00:11:04.634 --> 00:11:06.534
Today was National Sex Day.

00:11:06.534 --> 00:11:09.601
Ew!

00:11:09.601 --> 00:11:11.701
During the day?!

00:11:18.901 --> 00:11:21.734
A group of pro-choice,
topless protesters

00:11:21.734 --> 00:11:23.300
with green paint
on their chests

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:26.901
stormed the court of a WNBA game
in Brooklyn this week,

00:11:26.901 --> 00:11:29.300
but the NYPD announced
that no charges were filed.

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:31.100
Apparently,
they couldn't make an arrest

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:33.267
because nobody
saw their faces.

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:41.133
"Oh, not I!"

00:11:41.133 --> 00:11:44.100
There's no way
I would not look at a face!

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:51.000
The cosmetics company
Nails Inc recently launched

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.334
a line of
cheese scented nail polishes.

00:11:53.334 --> 00:11:57.868
Or if that's too expensive,
just eat one handful of Cheetos.

00:12:00.701 --> 00:12:03.334
And finally, a man in Wales
broke a Guinness world record

00:12:03.334 --> 00:12:06.801
after drinking at 56 pubs
in 24 hours.

00:12:06.801 --> 00:12:10.667
It was for
"Most sober man in Wales."

00:12:10.667 --> 00:12:13.634
And that was the monologue,
everybody, oh!

00:12:13.634 --> 00:12:18.300
♪♪

